From 4047acd16effbe36d4ae9c111a4036ad4a1c3a3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:25:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(telemetry): measure storage IOPS from diskstats and show
 on dashboards

Host metrics difference /proc/diskstats per physical disk (read/write IOPS
and MiB/s), skip NVMe partitions, and fall back to a writable sample file
so rates are not stuck unavailable. The same tick as CPU/RAM carries
storageIops onto the Storage dashboard, environment ticker, and hardware
HUDs. Live CSI backend cards keep IOPS as unavailable instead of a fake 0.
